    },
    {
      "id": "6d7e8f9011223344",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1030,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "**Per Market**\n- select token side (yes/no)\n- fetch orderbook (OpenAPI/Frontend)\n- best bid/ask + price at level\n- validate prices\n- reference price\n- update buy/sell orders (cancel/replace)"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e8f901122334455",
